    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>What defines one\u2019s nature when the inner self is lost?</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Metaneurosis</strong> is a surreal, story-rich turn-based RPG blending tactical combat, dark humor, and emotional introspection. Navigate bizarre mindscapes shaped by fear, memory, and unresolved pain\u2014where every absurd encounter hides something meaningful underneath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>What does it cost to stay true to oneself?</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as someone stuck in life\u2014mentally, emotionally, and maybe literally. Each world you enter is a manifestation of a deeper struggle, filled with talking skeletons, corporate nightmares, undead seagulls, and the occasional flying walrus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s ridiculous\u2014until it isn\u2019t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483990/extras/31e5965e60a0394b1af398ff2d433b9c.poster.avif?t=1750802054\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483990/extras/31e5965e60a0394b1af398ff2d433b9c.apng?t=1750802054\" class=\"bb_img\" width=140 height=92 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-Based Tactical Combat</strong><br>Build a party of uniquely unstable characters. Plan your moves\u2014or just throw a can and hope for the best.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surreal Worlds to Explore</strong><br>Travel through layered mental landscapes, each with its own twisted logic, inhabitants, and narrative weight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Humor Meets Emotional Depth</strong><br>Laugh through the nonsense. Then brace yourself for when it stops being funny.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Team</strong><br>Build a party of oddballs with a mix of ridiculous and powerful abilities that suit your strategy\u2014or your neuroses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483990/extras/0f241f9987750c7499bcfc7d779dee62.poster.avif?t=1750802054\" width=192 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483990/extras/0f241f9987750c7499bcfc7d779dee62.webm?t=1750802054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles, Secrets, and Side Quests</strong><br>Discover hidden stories, strange mechanics, and meaningful side content across each world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Creation &amp; Progression</strong><br>Personalize your look and unlock new outfits as you push deeper into yourself\u2014or someone else.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optional Story Mode</strong><br>Skip combat entirely and experience the full narrative journey, surreal humor, and emotional depth at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483990/extras/3332066928cb48d1d78c10f3f5c5c859.poster.avif?t=1750802054\" width=560 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483990/extras/3332066928cb48d1d78c10f3f5c5c859.webm?t=1750802054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re battling spaghetti lawyers, seeking crablightenment, or confronting your own inner saboteur, <strong>Metaneurosis</strong> is a love letter to RPGs\u2014and to the beautiful mess of being human.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>What defines one\u2019s nature when the inner self is lost?</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Metaneurosis</strong> is a surreal, story-rich turn-based RPG blending tactical combat, dark humor, and emotional introspection. Navigate bizarre mindscapes shaped by fear, memory, and unresolved pain\u2014where every absurd encounter hides something meaningful underneath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>What does it cost to stay true to oneself?</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as someone stuck in life\u2014mentally, emotionally, and maybe literally. Each world you enter is a manifestation of a deeper struggle, filled with talking skeletons, corporate nightmares, undead seagulls, and the occasional flying walrus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s ridiculous\u2014until it isn\u2019t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483990/extras/31e5965e60a0394b1af398ff2d433b9c.poster.avif?t=1750802054\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483990/extras/31e5965e60a0394b1af398ff2d433b9c.apng?t=1750802054\" class=\"bb_img\" width=140 height=92 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-Based Tactical Combat</strong><br>Build a party of uniquely unstable characters. Plan your moves\u2014or just throw a can and hope for the best.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surreal Worlds to Explore</strong><br>Travel through layered mental landscapes, each with its own twisted logic, inhabitants, and narrative weight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Humor Meets Emotional Depth</strong><br>Laugh through the nonsense. Then brace yourself for when it stops being funny.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Team</strong><br>Build a party of oddballs with a mix of ridiculous and powerful abilities that suit your strategy\u2014or your neuroses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483990/extras/0f241f9987750c7499bcfc7d779dee62.poster.avif?t=1750802054\" width=192 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483990/extras/0f241f9987750c7499bcfc7d779dee62.webm?t=1750802054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles, Secrets, and Side Quests</strong><br>Discover hidden stories, strange mechanics, and meaningful side content across each world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Creation &amp; Progression</strong><br>Personalize your look and unlock new outfits as you push deeper into yourself\u2014or someone else.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optional Story Mode</strong><br>Skip combat entirely and experience the full narrative journey, surreal humor, and emotional depth at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483990/extras/3332066928cb48d1d78c10f3f5c5c859.poster.avif?t=1750802054\" width=560 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483990/extras/3332066928cb48d1d78c10f3f5c5c859.webm?t=1750802054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re battling spaghetti lawyers, seeking crablightenment, or confronting your own inner saboteur, <strong>Metaneurosis</strong> is a love letter to RPGs\u2014and to the beautiful mess of being human.</p>",
